        "original_id": "cd5fe63b-9e9f-57ba-a9a8-470018bcdb09",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Grant Hart\n- Organizations: Hüsker Dü, Nova Mob\n- Products: 2541\n- Roles: drummer, co-songwriter, vocalist, guitarist\n\nFacts:\n- Grant Vernon Hart was born on March 18, 1961, and died on September 13, 2017.\n- Grant Hart was an American musician best known as the drummer and co-songwriter for the alternative rock and hardcore punk band Hüsker Dü.\n- After Hüsker Dü broke up in 1988, Grant Hart formed the alternative rock trio Nova Mob and moved to vocals and guitar.\n- 2541 was the first solo EP by Grant Hart, formerly of Hüsker Dü.",
